{"id": null, "n": "0372004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0372004", "type": "orig", "text": "據原卷殘狀，此處約殘十字，疑為「佛初築塔時，人眾如恒沙」。參見錄文一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0372005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0372005", "type": "orig", "text": "據原卷殘狀，此處約殘九字，疑為「賢作維那，藥王作都講」。參見錄文一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0373001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0373001", "type": "orig", "text": "「柱」，底本作「住」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0373002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0373002", "type": "orig", "text": "此字不清，疑作「來」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0373003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0373003", "type": "orig", "text": "「把」，底本作「霸」，據北新627號及斯2714號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0373004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0373004", "type": "orig", "text": "「把」，底本作「霸」，據北新627號及斯2714號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0373005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0373005", "type": "orig", "text": "底本此處原空一字。"}
